# DPM
#
# The planning database itself is NOT ignored here — .dpm/.gitignore holds
# `dpm.db*`, written by DPM before the database was created so there is no
# window in which an unignored dpm.db can be staged. Do not duplicate it here,
# and do not add `.dpm/` or `*.sql`:
#
#   .dpm/dpm.sql  is the database's committed text form and MUST be committed —
#                 it is what a fresh clone restores from.
#   docs/         is generated from the database and MUST be committed — the
#                 pre-commit guard regenerates it and refuses if it differs.
#
# Ignoring either would defeat the guard and lose the corpus.
